            <ArticleTitle>The levels of pain experienced with lower limb fractures.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>34-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper gives an overview of a small study of practice in Coventry and Warwickshire Hospital. The study set out to discover how long male patients experienced unrelieved pain following admission to hospital with fractures to their lower limbs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
